{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55236","headline":"述怀 · 李愚","name":"述怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奉职常如履薄冰，屡看斜日下觚棱。\n盐梅且让当朝杰，粥饭甘爲退院僧。\n虚负紫宸思宠渥，自伤白发病侵凌。\n明年便向燕南去，竹坞云庵独枕肱。\n（见民国十四年刊张方墀纂《无棣县志》卷二十三。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李愚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}